+
+| ID | Load-bearing assumption | Observable falsifier | Who checks |
+|----|------------------------|----------------------|------------|
+| A1 | Ordinary pre-existing funding/resource policy is sufficient to run the four offices without new paid authority; zero-billed/paid tier verification stays on the exact dispatch path. | A verified dispatch occurs on a provider-billed route with no independently verified account/provider ceiling, a `-free`-looking paid id is admitted as zero-billed, or the `knowledge-act34-gate.py` byte/digest chain is absent or unverified on the exact dispatch path. | Economy + Judiciary (Act 15) |
